    <h1>One simple plan. <em>Everything included.</em></h1>
    <p>There is exactly one way to work with me, and the whole arrangement is laid out on this page in plain language. I design the site, build it, host it, maintain it, and stay with the work for as long as you are with me. There are no tiers above or below the standard plan, no surprise add-ons, and no upsells later in the engagement. The single monthly rate covers every feature on the site, including the blog, and the only thing that ever gets billed separately is hourly work that genuinely sits outside the scope of the plan.</p>
